{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pirate's Gambit</strong>, you step into the eerie gamble left behind by Captain Kidd. To survive, you must <strong>build</strong> your deck wisely, master the dice and items, and make each move count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As new routes unfold, you will traverse uncharted lands, from scorching volcanoes to frozen wastelands and beyond as you gradually uncover the ship\u2019s long-buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/dccb9302891d68759db4fa3031b9ecbc.poster.avif?t=1764956169\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/dccb9302891d68759db4fa3031b9ecbc.webm?t=1764956169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/extras/dccb9302891d68759db4fa3031b9ecbc.mp4?t=1764956169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something lurks in the shadows. Are you the one controlling the dice, or merely a pawn in their game?\u00a0In this gamble with no way back, the only certainty is that every roll could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532360?t=1764956169","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532360?t=1764956169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/588e88be0e3ea71dcb5a5eb32aa6b2eefb42f54f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764956169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532360/588e88be0e3ea71dcb5a5eb32aa6b2eefb42f54f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764956169","catego